{"speciesId":509,"names":{"fr":"Chacripan","es":"Purrloin","en":"Purrloin","ja":"チョロネコ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vole les gens pour le plaisir, mais il est tellement mignon que ses victimes finissent toujours par lui pardonner."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They steal from people for fun, but their victims can’t help but forgive them. Their deceptively cute act is perfect."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il détourne l’attention de ses victimes avec ses gestes mignons pour mieux les détrousser. En colère, il griffe."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Their cute act is a ruse. They trick people and steal their valuables just to see the looks on their faces."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Their cute act is a ruse. They trick people and steal their valuables just to see the looks on their faces."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il détourne l’attention de ses victimes avec ses gestes mignons pour mieux les détrousser. En colère, il griffe."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Distrae a su oponente con movimientos gráciles y sustrae sus pertenencias. Cuando se enfada, ataca con las garras."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"かわいらしい 仕草で 油断させて その すきに 持ち物を 奪う。 怒ると ツメを 立てて 反撃。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vole les gens pour le plaisir, mais il est tellement mignon que ses victimes finissent toujours par lui pardonner."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Hurta a los humanos por mera diversión, pero las víctimas lo perdonan al ver a este Pokémon tan encantador."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"They steal from people for fun, bu